        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# What Could a Node Template Be?\n\nA brainstorm about a node template, given that a page template and an edge class template already exist: what it would hold, how it relates to them, and what it must not become.\n\nSeven ideas, six questions, three constraints and what the two existing templates already show. Nothing here is decided."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-template-brainstorm"
        }
      }
    },
