      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Fields are rows, like properties",
        "statement": "Each data field of the class is a row in the template: name, type, required, default. The class's required keys and default data are derived from those rows, the way the edge template derives its kinds and limits from Properties.",
        "status": "spark",
        "confidence": "unproven",
        "notes": "Today a class lists required data key names and a blob of defaults. Rows would let the template say more, and check it.",
        "definitionKey": "idea",
        "_classBinding": {
