        "title": "Views are authored, with a generated fallback",
        "statement": "A node class needs an icon, a summary, a detail and an editor. Author them as View nodes and let them form the view sequence. When none is authored, generate a plain one from the fields so every class has something to show.",
        "status": "spark",
        "confidence": "unproven",
        "notes": "The view sequence gives the fallback order. A generated detail from the fields would be the last entry in it.",
