      "data": {
        "title": "A class can ship its Handler and Method",
        "statement": "Like the page template, a class comes with the Event Handlers that watch it and the Method they call, so keeping its derived views current is part of the class and not something each graph re-wires.",
        "status": "spark",
        "confidence": "unproven",
        "notes": "The page template does this with one Handler per role class and one Method. A node class that has derived data would want the same.",
