    {
      "id": "node-template-brainstorm-n-page",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "What the page template does",
      "position": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": -300
      },
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root",
          "metadata": {
            "structural": true,
            "relationship": true,
            "role": "content.root",
            "required": false,
            "repeatable": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-template-brainstorm"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## What the page template does\n\nIt has 22 nodes and four role classes (masthead, route, section, settings).\nEach class has an Event Handler watching `node.changed`, and one more watches `graph.structure.changed`. All of them invoke one Method.\nThat Method writes the icon, summary and detail views. The order of the page is the order of the nodes in the graph.\n\n*Takeaway: a class can ship its own upkeep. The class is not only data.*"
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      },
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "portId": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node-template-brainstorm-n-edge",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "What the edge class template does",
      "position": {
        "x": 1060,
        "y": -300
      },
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root",
          "metadata": {
            "structural": true,
            "relationship": true,
            "role": "content.root",
            "required": false,
            "repeatable": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-template-brainstorm"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## What the edge class template does\n\nProperties hold the key, label, meaning, the kinds it connects, its limits, route and arrow. Stroke fields say how it paints.\nA Method reads them, checks them against the same rules the editor uses, and writes the icon, summary and a detail page.\nThe page has Settings, Description and Evidence sections. Each edge class is one graph, listed by a Collection and included by default.\n\n*Takeaway: a class defined by rows, with a page that shows it, is a pleasant thing to author.*"
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      },
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "portId": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node-template-brainstorm-n-today",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "What a node class is today",
      "position": {
        "x": 1560,
        "y": -300
      },
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root",
          "metadata": {
            "structural": true,
            "relationship": true,
            "role": "content.root",
            "required": false,
            "repeatable": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-template-brainstorm"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## What a node class is today\n\nThe public library has 103 node-class files. Each holds a label, a default size, default data, ports, events, required keys and views. Page Section, for example, is 520 by 320 with one top port and a `node.changed` event.\nA Bridge imports a class into a graph, and each node made from it carries a copy of the class in `_classBinding`.\nAbout thirty core node types are not classes at all. They live in the JavaScript registry.\n\n*Takeaway: the shape exists, it is scattered, and the core is missing.*"
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      },
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "portId": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node-template-brainstorm-sketch",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "A node template, sketched",
      "position": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 200
      },
      "width": 640,
      "height": 520,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root",
          "metadata": {
            "structural": true,
            "relationship": true,
            "role": "content.root",
            "required": false,
            "repeatable": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "node-template-brainstorm"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# A node template, sketched\n\nNames and details are illustrative until the questions are answered.\n\n## The graph\n\n| Part | What it holds |\n|---|---|\n| **Identity** | Properties: key, label, meaning, the kinds it also counts as. |\n| **Fields** | One row each: name, type, required, default. |\n| **Ports** | One row each: id, direction, side, offset, data type, edge classes accepted, what dragging creates. |\n| **Views** | Icon, summary, detail and editor as View nodes, in the view sequence. A generated fallback when none. |\n| **Events** | The events it fires, such as `node.changed`. |\n| **Behavior** | The Handlers that watch it and the Method they call. |\n| **Page** | Settings, Description and Evidence sections, and a live specimen. |\n\n## What it must not become\n\nA second place to keep the same facts. If the fields, ports and views are rows here, the class is derived from them, and nothing else says the same thing again."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      },
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "portId": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "role": "content.root"
        }
      ]
    },
